  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening GBV Prevention and Response through Integrated Health, WASH, and Cash Support in North and Central Darfur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will deliver an integrated response in North and Central Darfur, prioritising enhanced support for survivors of conflict-related sexual violence and other forms of gender-based violence (GBV), while also addressing critical health and WASH needs for displaced and conflict-affected populations. The intervention will focus on improving access to survivor-centred services, strengthening protection systems, and reducing immediate risks faced by women, girls, and vulnerable groups in highly affected areas.</narrative>
  </description>
